WEBVTT

00:08:29.667 --> 00:08:33.433
which happened in 2001.

00:08:33.457 --> 00:08:39.601
And as we know, 9/11 caused
a lot of shock and grief.

00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:42.976
I personally experienced
the shock and grief

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:47.583
because I was in Manhattan
when 9/11 happened.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:52.851
9/11 also generated a lot of anger,

00:08:52.875 --> 00:08:57.559
and in this anger, the United States
decided to invade Afghanistan

00:08:57.583 --> 00:08:59.542
and later, Iraq.